# Atlas v2 needs no environment variables for local dev or for the Vercel
# production deploy. The site is fully static — no database, no auth, no
# external API keys.
#
# The one optional var is the GH-Pages basePath, which only matters when
# you're building the site for deploy under a sub-path (the personal site
# embeds Atlas at /atlas/). Leave it unset for Vercel.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_ATLAS_BASE_PATH=/atlas
